  "body": "If you are looking for an easy care home where almost everything you need is just a few minutes level walk from your front door, this could be the one you have been waiting for.\r\nPerfectly positioned on Bute Road, midway between the bowling club and Browns Bay Library, this lovely single level brick and tile home offers an enviable combination of comfort, convenience and low maintenance living.\r\nTastefully renovated and beautifully presented, the home features polished hardwood floors, a modern kitchen and a light filled open plan dining and living area that creates a warm and welcoming heart to the home. Two comfortable bedrooms are complemented by a stylish modern bathroom.\r\nStep outside and discover just how easy life can be. Take a leisurely stroll along beautiful Browns Bay Beach, meet friends for a morning coffee or lunch, enjoy an exercise class at the community centre, visit the library, or wander down to the bowling club or RSA. When you don't feel like cooking, you are spoilt for choice with more than 40 cafés, restaurants and takeaway options, all within an easy five minute walk.\r\nLow maintenance brick and tile construction, easy care grounds and a generous garage mean there is more time to enjoy everything this wonderful location has to offer. And if you prefer to leave the car at home, public transport is almost at your doorstep.\r\nHomes offering single level living in such a wonderfully convenient Browns Bay location are always sought after and seldom available. Be quick to make this beauty yours.",
